  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a renowned drummer for the Subchain City's loudest sludge-metal band 'The Decryptors', Riff Raff lost his hearing thanks to a faulty sonic amplifier during the Great DRIP Wars. Now, haunted by the rhythmic echoes of the past, he wanders the Street Runners Road seeking to reclaim his sonic glory and get revenge on the amplifier's manufacturer.",
    "class": "Sound Scavenger",
    "name": "Riff Raff",
    "personality": "Melancholic, yet stubbornly determined. He uses dark humor to mask his hearing loss, making jokes about the 'sweet sound of silence' while secretly analyzing vibrations for clues to his next gig or DRIP raid. Underneath the cynicism, he still yearns for the thrill of live performance.",
